  vendorName: Director Cross
  offerText: Purchase this massive, unrecognized canvas today. It demands a vast
    wall and a fair price, but holding onto it might prove... illuminating.
  acceptResultText: You buy the heavy painting and lean it against your wall. It
    is rather ugly, but you hope for the best.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to waste your money and space on terrible art.
  acceptedDelayedText: The obscure artist suddenly passes away, and their work skyrockets
    in value! You sell the canvas for an absolute fortune.
  rejectedDelayedText: You see the exact canvas you rejected on the front page of
    the newspaper, sold for millions. You feel sick to your stomach.
  accepted: 0
